Package: com.itsallexb.batteryplus
Name: BatteryPlus (iOS 12)
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Battery features of modern iOS for iOS 12 iPads. Low Power Mode in Settings > Battery and in Control Center (with CCSupport), and Automatic Low Power Mode: on when the battery drops to 5, 10, 15 or 20%, off again at 80%. Battery Percentage next to the battery icon or inside it, like modern iOS. Battery Health with Maximum Capacity, Cycle Count and Manufacture Date from the battery's gas gauge, and an optional Unplug Reminder.
Maintainer: itsAllexB
Author: itsAllexB
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 12.0), firmware (<< 13.0)
Recommends: com.opa334.ccsupport
